# The task board is a pure function of tasks/open and tasks/done, and every task that is
# filed, claimed or finished rewrites the whole file. Committing it made each of those
# pull requests collide with every other one in the same few table rows (PRs #404, #409,
# #410 in one day), so it is generated on demand instead: `npm run tasks:board`.
tasks/BOARD.md
